sangati sampradana

  "karaka-amsha"
  "chaturthi-vibhakti-yukta phala-yukta"
  -- recipient: to whom the fruit of action is directed
  -- vibhakti: chaturthi (dative)
  -- sangati root: phala (fruit) — where the result arrives

shabda recipient / the-one-to-whom-the-agent-directs-the-fruit-of-action

done
